    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=602039852283724327&sectionId=602039852401426983)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2Oscwl-W8_text","label":"gg2Oscwl-W8_text","default":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_0","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is my order discreet?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_1","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_1","default":"<p>How is FloraFresh different from other probiotics?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_2","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_2","default":"<p>How long until I see results?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_3","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_3","default":"<p>Are there any side effects?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_4","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_4","default":"<p>Can I take it with medications?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_5","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is FloraFresh safe during pregnancy or breastfeeding?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_6","label":"gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_6","default":"<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYXA5zkioG_text","label":"ggYXA5zkioG_text","default":"<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4a8x2zCkC_text","label":"gg4a8x2zCkC_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh uses Acid-Armor™ delayed-release technology — a 3-step \"Flush &amp; Feed\" system featuring D-Mannose, 4 targeted Lactobacillus strains (15 Billion CFUs), and Prebiotic XOS designed to maximize absorption. Standard probiotics lose up to 95% of their bacteria in stomach acid.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRqXQmTkxv_text","label":"ggRqXQmTkxv_text","default":"<p>Most women notice initial improvements within 2-3 weeks. Significant results typically occur between weeks 3-4. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjhL2ttWiu_text","label":"ggjhL2ttWiu_text","default":"<p>FloraFresh is generally well-tolerated. Some women experience mild digestive adjustment during the first few days. This typically resolves within 3-5 days.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrHHYhxxS4_text","label":"ggrHHYhxxS4_text","default":"<p>If you're taking antibiotics, we recommend taking FloraFresh at least 2 hours apart. For specific medication interactions, please consult your healthcare provider.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJbZr565_u_text","label":"ggJbZr565_u_text","default":"<p>While our ingredients are generally considered safe, we recommend consulting your OB-GYN before starting any new supplement during pregnancy or breastfeeding.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmO4sNTttZ_text","label":"ggmO4sNTttZ_text","default":"<p>We offer a 90-day \"Empty Bottle Promise\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottleis empty.</p>"}],
